    so with c_1 = -c_3 = K_B the K_B terms cancel and -c_1 A - c_3 C + c_4 a^2 = (c_1 + c_4) a^2 = c_14 a^2.
    Tested at exact rational points on two random polynomial clock profiles: residuals [0, 0]
